sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant LB as Load Balancer
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant R as Hash Ring
    participant N as Storage Node

    C->>LB: GET object key=user:42
    LB->>GW: forward
    GW->>R: hash(user:42) = 0x8F2A
    R->>R: walk ring clockwise<br/>first vnode ≥ 0x8F2A
    R-->>GW: primary = Node C
    GW->>N: read key from Node C
    N-->>GW: value
    GW-->>C: 200 OK
